IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. Q01-BALANCE-CALC.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-OPEN-BAL        PIC S9(9) VALUE 0.
01 WS-DEPOSIT         PIC S9(9) VALUE 0.
01 WS-FINAL-BAL       PIC S9(10) VALUE 0.
01 WS-DISP-BAL        PIC Z(9)9.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
ACCEPT WS-OPEN-BAL
ACCEPT WS-DEPOSIT
IF WS-OPEN-BAL < 0 OR WS-DEPOSIT < 0
    DISPLAY "INVALID INPUT"
ELSE
    COMPUTE WS-FINAL-BAL = WS-OPEN-BAL + WS-DEPOSIT
    MOVE WS-FINAL-BAL TO WS-DISP-BAL
    DISPLAY FUNCTION TRIM(WS-DISP-BAL)
END-IF
STOP RUN.
